        <untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>SX</untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Dizziness is a term used to describe a range of sensations, such as feeling faint, woozy, weak or unsteady. Severe dizziness is a more pronounced feeling of dizziness.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


