        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Weighing well above a person&apos;s ideal weight, generally characterized as a Body Mass Index (BMI) of 30 and above. (NCI)</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/danielhier/ontologies/2019/3/untitled-ontology-57#obesity_CTCAE -->

