        <untitled-ontology-57:CUI>C4551560</untitled-ontology-57:CUI>
        <untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>SX</untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Abdominal obesity, also known as central obesity and truncal obesity, is a condition when excessive abdominal fat around the stomach and abdomen has built up to the extent that it is likely to have a negative impact on health.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


