        <untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>SX</untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Tingling (paresthesia) is an unusual sensation most commonly felt in your hands, feet, arms and legs. Tingling is often associated with numbness, or a decrease in the ability to feel or sense pressure or texture.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


