        <untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>MS</untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>A disorder characterized by the acute and sudden development of confusion, illusions, movement changes, inattentiveness, agitation, and hallucinations. Usually, it is a reversible condition.A disorder characterized by the acute and sudden development of confusion, illusions, movement changes, inattentiveness, agitation, and hallucinations. Usually, it is a reversible condition.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


