        <untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>CN</untitled-ontology-57:Exam_Part>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>If you are hoarse, your voice will sound breathy, raspy, or strained, or will be softer in volume or lower in pitch. Your throat might feel scratchy. Hoarseness is often a symptom of problems in the vocal folds of the larynx</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/danielhier/ontologies/2019/3/untitled-ontology-57/homocidal_ideation -->

