        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Judgment refers to the patient&apos;s capacity to make sound, reasoned and responsible decisions.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>lack_of_judgment; loss_of_judgment</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


