        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Abnormally small head.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>Abnormally small cranium; Abnormally small head; Abnormally small skull; Decreased circumference of cranium; Decreased size of cranium; Decreased size of head; Decreased size of skull; Microcephaly; Reduced head circumference; small calvarium; small cranium; Small head; Small head circumference&apos; Small skull</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/danielhier/ontologies/2019/3/untitled-ontology-57/micrographia -->

