        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Naming or speech with incorrect word substitutions, sometimes in meaning and sometimes in sound.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/danielhier/ontologies/2019/3/untitled-ontology-57/paraplegia -->

